    {"id":"d-note1","type":"text","x":1680,"y":2780,"width":1040,"height":25,"text":"Best for collecting ideas quickly. This option changes the add flow, not just the layout.","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#242933"},
    {"id":"d-note2","type":"text","x":1680,"y":2822,"width":1040,"height":125,"text":"Add is disabled until a title is entered. Enter saves a new idea, clears the field and keeps focus.\nFull form carries over the title. Existing activities still open their details, Move and calendar actions.\nUse the current new-activity defaults. A suggestion chip saves that suggestion directly.\nAll checkpoint numbers are bold and unboxed, including on hover. Number handles still reorder.\nWhite throughout, with blue text for the open checkpoint. The input outline is focus, not a selected-row fill.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#526174"},
    {"id":"d-m-note","type":"text","x":2780,"y":2544,"width":370,"height":100,"text":"Tradeoff: a new quick-add flow\nneeds save / error feedback.\nOn phones, input and actions\nstack; all targets stay 44 px.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"strokeColor":"#526174"}
